  "rationale": {
    "decoder_function": "These libxml2 functions decode a single UTF-8 sequence from input bytes, with xmlGetUTF8Char as the core decoder.",
    "input_byte": "CUR is the parser macro for the current input byte, while utf and cur are the byte/string parameters holding the first byte in the UTF-8 decoder functions.",
    "continuation_count": "xmlUTF8Size computes the total byte length (1 + continuation count) from the leading byte, and count/len are the local variables holding the continuation count in the decoder functions."
